<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuelan authorities have detained former world champion boxer Linares on US immigration charges while appointing a gay man as foreign minister, indicating internal political shifts. The government has accused Uruguay's president of interference over calls for free elections and granted a US-backed firm 100-year control of 17 oil fields, expanding foreign involvement in the oil sector. Cuba has activated wartime structures in response to US President Trump's statements about Cuba, and a special forces soldier who bet $400,000 on Maduro's capture pleaded not guilty, showing personal stakes in the conflict. 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNNXIyMjB0bmNDczNUZ2dldlNWWmJuZlFBX0lhZmJWVThuWVFIVlIzN2dDSXU2ai1QVTFjemxKQ2hENkUxZEFtekl6WktjazBKSkhocWZJRm5fXzZ6MFFGU052ZVpaWWNiaHNudkpRMTM1MUF6akdZOXp3azg0RkNxaUY2VUZTSV9JbWlUU2hGOF91WkcxQXV2NmRGZGpDbHZEbG9YejMwZjV6dkZ3Mm5LRHMwaDdnZzVLS2R5bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQVUJGTmU0OUlnNHg1QVdVRUZsQVZkMWZ2MzhqRFBIMzFxOUNpN3AtUUl6a1lSZnNnZ3hpbUJUeFNqLS1mNlJtVHJtRk1UZFhNNmU1X0ZkS083UEF1S3F1TUJHS0tOaF9PalpmVEJMZjg2blpsRHVHeU05enVwakI2cFc0LXhmM3loeWotMkNyVGxsZEh5VVhxeDNZQzJtdnRlMGZaMGxiYXp3V0JnZWFwT2ZzYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNc3hZYTV0V0dmeFlaMTRYdVA0X3NkNW5DUVdfU1lyRkFGMUQ4NzQzQk1XUUhubzZXT0I0VGdLS0N2R0c2WjVDNUtBWXQ4QXJKZk9mWEx6MXR6azVjcW9UNU1GS1FHWmFVQnNuSEhqb0dPSTZySE9pb0FxMzRzMi1vcENnajA3SVpKb1JWLVgtNEp0aHNMeEhCMUtWdG0yTmhrQ011c0taUWhPMWh3WTJ5V0h1Mjlsa255RWZZQ2FVSHZNbzFXVE9F?oc=5&quot;&gt;Venezuelanalysis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNUnVFOWVhODFQc1A1R2djUGk